<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Eurotel Bratislava chooses Ericsson.</title>
<headline>Eurotel Bratislava chooses Ericsson.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eurotel Bratislava, a joint venture between US West Media Group, Bell Atlantic Intl and Slovenske Telekomunikacie has chosen Swedish telcom concern Ericsson as the main supplier for its Slovak GSM operation.</p>
<p>In a statment from its Prague office, US West said that Ericsson would provide network infrastructure, SMS and voicemail for the network. It did not say how much the contract was worth.</p>
